  "notes": "Three copies of the same back-view pinout with callouts and silkscreen (18, 9, D+, D-, SCL, SDA, TX, RX, 3V3, G, 5V). For TX/RX the callouts U0TXD/U0RXD are peripheral names, so the silkscreen board name is the label and the callout goes in functions. Battery (BAT) and speaker (SPK) connectors have only +/- marks and are skipped."
